<title>USA: Meredith raises dividend, splits stock.</title>
<headline>Meredith raises dividend, splits stock.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES, Iowa 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meredith Corp, a large media company, said its directors Monday voted to increase the company's quarterly dividend rate and split the company's shares.</p>
<p>Meredith directors voted to increase the quarterly dividend to $0.13 a share from  $0.11. The new dividend is payable March 14, to holders of record February 28.</p>
<p>Meredith's board also voted a two-for-one stock split in the form of a stock dividend payable March 17, record February 28.</p>
<p>Meredith shares were trading off 1/4 to 51-1/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
